1) Initial recon

1. Port scanning using <nmap>
- scan Ports to find open ones and then do more focused scans 
 $ nmap -Pn -sS -p-
 $ nmap -Pn -sS -sV -sC -p[port_num] 

2. DNS enumeration
- discover subdomains using:
 $ subfinder -d website.com -v
 $ dnsenum --dnsserver (IP) --enum -p 0 -s 0 -o subdomains.txt -f top1million-110000.txt (URL)
- (optionally) double-check results with <httpx>

3. Website enumeration
- enumerate directories:
 $ dirb http://(target)
 $ gobuster dir -u <https://example.com> -w ~/wordlists/dir/common.txt`
- fuzz for web extensions
 $ ffuf -w web-extensions.txt:FUZZ -u http://SERVER_IP:PORT/directory/indexFUZZ
- vuln scanner
 $ nikto -h website.com -Tuning b

